        "answer": {
          "short": "$6\\times10^{-7}$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\frac{9.6\\times10^{14}}{1.6\\times10^{21}}&=\\frac{9.6}{1.6}\\times10^{14-21}\\\\\\frac{9.6\\times10^{14}}{1.6\\times10^{21}}&=6\\times10^{-7}\\end{align*}$$",
