        "answer": {
          "short": "$4.34\\times10^9$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\sqrt{9.61\\times10^{12}}\\times1.4\\times10^3&=(3.1\\times10^6)\\times1.4\\times10^3\\\\\\sqrt{9.61\\times10^{12}}\\times1.4\\times10^3&=(3.1\\times1.4)\\times10^{6+3}\\\\\\sqrt{9.61\\times10^{12}}\\times1.4\\times10^3&=4.34\\times10^9\\end{align*}$$",
