        "answer": {
          "short": "$1.6\\times10^2$\n\nEvaluate each root, multiply, then put the coefficient between 1 and 10.",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\sqrt[3]{64\\times10^9}\\times\\sqrt[5]{1024\\times10^{-10}}&=(4\\times10^3)(4\\times10^{-2})\\\\\\sqrt[3]{64\\times10^9}\\times\\sqrt[5]{1024\\times10^{-10}}&=16\\times10^{3-2}\\\\\\sqrt[3]{64\\times10^9}\\times\\sqrt[5]{1024\\times10^{-10}}&=1.6\\times10^2\\end{align*}$$",
